 "description": "This is the life the Aquila 50 Yacht power catamaran is made for: an elevated yachting experience that redefines exploration.\nWith its all-new \"Explorer\" aesthetic and commanding high freeboard, this remarkable yacht sets itself apart from the first glance. Sophisticated accommodations feature a standard 3-cabin layout with a single-level, full-beam master cabin and versatile utility room.\nRefined finishes and panoramic windows provide extraordinary views while ensuring comfort on each voyage. The expansive flybridge creates the perfect space for al fresco entertainment, while an optional interior helm offers added comfort during inclement weather.\nWith Category A ocean certification, you can confidently navigate open waters while enjoying the security of a vessel designed for serious offshore capability. Additional configuration options allow you to customize your yacht to match your cruising lifestyle as you embark on a new era of sophistication.",
